        "zh": "2025年10月30日至11月3日，本校師生赴上海參加「上海 MAKER FAIRE 深度學習交流活動」，展出以生成式 AI 介紹香港景點與美食、AI 編程及物聯網應用等作品，並與世界各地創客交流；行程亦走訪拙政園、平江歷史文化街、七里山塘及多倫路文化街。",
        "en": "From 30 October to 3 November 2025 our students travelled to Shanghai for the Shanghai Maker Faire Deep Learning Exchange, presenting generative-AI projects on Hong Kong landmarks and food, AI programming and IoT applications, talking with makers from around the world, and visiting the Humble Administrator’s Garden, Pingjiang Road, Shantang Street and Duolun Road."
